{
  "version": 1,
  "provenance": {
    "native_card_animation_a494_rodata": "Cluster formerly .data_09EEA494 is const pointer tables in existing card_animation_data.c; ordinary .rodata replaces the forced section (TU already has .data).",
    "card_animation": "Direct AnimInit tables and explicit animation/index bounds establish eleven common pairs. Full animation-frame and renderer sprite payloads agree in all regions. Pointer words outside proven consumer arrays are neutral scalar objects. EU selectors establish two additional localized pairs.",
    "native_b008_cluster": "The three pointer/AnimHeader clusters at gUnk_09EEB008, gUnk_09EEB050 and gUnk_09EEB068 form one contiguous 120-byte initialized-data run in every region; ordinary definitions in card_animation_data.c reproduce that run as native .data. event_sprite_data still owns the following 09EEB080 interrupt before the later 09EEB08C cluster."
  },
